WEBVTT

00:00:00.009 --> 00:02:45.830
[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]

00:02:56.800 --> 00:02:58.520
I had dinner with Wen Zongshu tonight,

00:02:58.680 --> 00:03:00.039
and kept hearing him go on about how

00:03:00.039 --> 00:03:01.840
all Taiwanese businessmen must report to the police station.

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:03.039
What's that all about?

00:03:03.199 --> 00:03:04.639
You're just taking things too seriously.

00:03:04.639 --> 00:03:05.439
Don't worry about it.

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:07.080
Wait until someone actually comes looking for you.

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:19.759
Could you please get

00:03:19.759 --> 00:03:21.960
Jin Lina from Room 216?

00:03:33.360 --> 00:03:34.080
It's me.

00:03:34.319 --> 00:03:37.120
Help me look for a place over the next few days.

00:03:40.159 --> 00:03:42.080
I found termites in this house.

00:03:42.199 --> 00:03:42.560
Besides,

00:03:45.719 --> 00:03:46.159
if there's a drill

00:03:46.159 --> 00:03:47.639
and a shell hits the sea,

00:03:47.639 --> 00:03:48.680
this place will shatter.

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:50.560
Then I'll rent a new place for you.

00:03:50.560 --> 00:03:51.599
Don't say it's for me.

00:03:51.599 --> 00:03:52.520
Just say you're renting it for yourself.

00:03:52.639 --> 00:03:53.319
Why?

00:03:53.520 --> 00:03:54.319
Isn't it obvious?

00:03:54.439 --> 00:03:55.919
Renting to a student versus a boss,

00:03:55.919 --> 00:03:57.039
is it the same price?

00:03:58.080 --> 00:03:58.400
Right.

00:03:58.599 --> 00:04:00.039
All right, make it quick.

00:04:35.240 --> 00:04:36.879
Institute of Research on the Structure of Matter, Academy of Sciences.

00:04:36.879 --> 00:04:37.959
Is this the right place?

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:40.399
Is this the duty room or the mailroom?

00:04:41.279 --> 00:04:43.560
This is the Gulou Public Security Sub-bureau.

00:04:43.959 --> 00:04:44.920
Is Huadong there?

00:04:45.560 --> 00:04:46.560
He works in applied chemistry.

00:04:47.319 --> 00:04:49.160
We need to ask him some questions.

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:52.079
Didn't the local police already come by?

00:04:52.079 --> 00:04:53.759
Huadong already gave a statement.

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:55.800
Why is your sub-bureau involved now?

00:04:57.360 --> 00:05:00.839
We need to review the injury assessment.

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:02.759
I'm asking you if he's there.

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:05.839
It's true that Huadong struck first,

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:07.839
but he ended up in the hospital, too.

00:05:08.279 --> 00:05:09.920
His injuries are pretty serious, too.

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:11.000
All right, got it.

00:05:11.319 --> 00:05:12.720
We'll call you again if needed.

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:13.560
All right, okay.

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:47.600
Do we have any soap?

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:49.279
Laundry detergent works too.

00:05:49.279 --> 00:05:50.480
I just checked.

00:05:50.480 --> 00:05:51.720
There's none left in the bathroom.

00:06:07.360 --> 00:06:08.079
The old one's all used up.

00:06:08.079 --> 00:06:09.680
The new one is by the washing machine.

00:06:16.959 --> 00:06:18.000
Can you hear me?

00:06:22.720 --> 00:06:24.040
The washing machine is out on the balcony.

00:06:25.040 --> 00:06:27.480
We usually do laundry and brush teeth on the balcony.

00:06:27.480 --> 00:06:28.959
There just aren't enough hangers.

00:06:28.959 --> 00:06:30.839
Remember to buy a few when you head out tomorrow.

00:06:30.920 --> 00:06:32.639
Toothpaste, toilet paper, laundry detergent...

00:06:32.639 --> 00:06:34.279
They're all down here in these cabinets.

00:06:34.800 --> 00:06:36.639
I hate making multiple trips to the corner store,

00:06:36.959 --> 00:06:38.680
so I buy lots of things by the case or in bulk,

00:06:38.680 --> 00:06:40.160
and keep them stacked up here.

00:06:40.240 --> 00:06:41.680
Food, daily supplies, it's all here.

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:43.399
Help yourself to whatever you need.

00:06:44.560 --> 00:06:46.399
There are instant noodles and milk in the kitchen.

00:06:46.639 --> 00:06:47.480
If you're in a rush on your way out

00:06:47.480 --> 00:06:48.319
and have no time to eat,

00:06:48.319 --> 00:06:49.839
you can grab one to line your stomach.

00:06:50.120 --> 00:06:52.839
Remember, this clay pot isn't for cooking.

00:06:52.839 --> 00:06:53.920
I use it to brew Chinese medicine.

00:06:53.920 --> 00:06:56.279
The doctor said not to mix it with regular food.

00:06:57.800 --> 00:06:58.639
This one inside,

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:00.000
the one in the glass bottle,

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:01.360
is for scrubbing the toilet.

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:02.399
I don't know what it's called either.

00:07:02.399 --> 00:07:04.079
Just remember, definitely don't drink it.

00:07:04.079 --> 00:07:05.959
The toilet's been acting up lately, always clogging.

00:07:05.959 --> 00:07:07.279
When you buy the hangers tomorrow,

00:07:07.279 --> 00:07:08.639
remember to pick up a plunger.

00:07:10.199 --> 00:07:12.160
Don't we need to monitor him at this hour?

00:07:12.720 --> 00:07:14.000
Or is he already asleep?

00:07:14.839 --> 00:07:15.600
Every day at this hour,

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:17.319
he makes instant noodles for himself.

00:07:17.319 --> 00:07:19.040
Cooking and eating takes at least half an hour.

00:07:19.560 --> 00:07:21.000
When you guys go out drinking,

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:22.360
do you never get enough to eat?

00:07:26.680 --> 00:07:28.600
I just bought this pajama set after work.

00:07:28.600 --> 00:07:30.160
Try it on to see if it's too big or small.

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:31.639
Don't just make do with it.

00:07:31.639 --> 00:07:33.480
I need to know your actual size.

00:07:36.279 --> 00:07:37.680
Aren't you brewing Chinese medicine?

00:07:38.160 --> 00:07:39.240
Why are you still drinking alcohol?

00:07:39.240 --> 00:07:40.199
Do you want a drink?

00:07:40.920 --> 00:07:42.079
I don't drink.

00:07:42.079 --> 00:07:43.240
If it weren't for work,

00:07:43.240 --> 00:07:44.480
I wouldn't touch a single drop.

00:07:44.720 --> 00:07:46.160
Wait until you've done surveillance for six months

00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:48.920
and your sleep is completely wrecked, then we'll see.

00:07:49.959 --> 00:07:52.160
This and the Chinese medicine are both to help me sleep.

00:07:58.000 --> 00:07:59.560
When do you usually shower?

00:07:59.800 --> 00:08:00.920
In the morning or at night?

00:08:01.839 --> 00:08:03.000
Either works for me.

00:08:03.680 --> 00:08:04.519
Come sit here.

00:08:07.319 --> 00:08:08.959
Why are you always so evasive?

00:08:12.680 --> 00:08:14.639
What are you gripping in your pocket that you can't take out?

00:08:27.439 --> 00:08:28.959
Don't you feel awkward?

00:08:29.959 --> 00:08:31.160
You can't even look me in the eye.

00:08:31.279 --> 00:08:32.399
Did you do something wrong?

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:34.320
Stole someone's fiancée?

00:08:34.639 --> 00:08:36.080
Afraid the neighbors will gossip?

00:08:36.440 --> 00:08:38.080
Or are your moral standards too high,

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:39.320
and your conscience is bothering you?

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:42.120
He Chunxiao, we're a couple passionately in love.

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:43.919
Not on our first blind date.

00:08:46.320 --> 00:08:46.960
Understood.

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:48.000
No, you don't.

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:50.240
We have to learn everything about each other right away.

00:08:50.399 --> 00:08:51.120
Where we have ulcers,

00:08:51.120 --> 00:08:52.799
or eczema—we must remember it all.

00:08:53.399 --> 00:08:54.519
I have a mole on my back.

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:55.799
I thought it was for romance.

00:08:56.039 --> 00:08:58.320
My mom consulted a fortune-teller who said no,

00:08:58.759 --> 00:09:00.399
it means the fragrance of plum blossoms comes from the bitter cold,

00:09:01.559 --> 00:09:02.519
that I was born to toil.

00:09:07.960 --> 00:09:08.960
I'm a local,

00:09:09.159 --> 00:09:09.919
but I like strong flavors

00:09:09.919 --> 00:09:10.759
and spicy food.

00:09:10.919 --> 00:09:12.120
I've had nightmares since childhood,

00:09:12.120 --> 00:09:13.039
never sleeping well.

00:09:13.039 --> 00:09:14.000
So my dad told me

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:16.039
to slip a pair of scissors under my pillow,

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:17.960
so I could sleep soundly until morning.

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:19.240
If you don't sleep well,

00:09:19.360 --> 00:09:20.320
you can try it, too.

00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:22.639
I don't drink milk for breakfast.

00:09:22.639 --> 00:09:23.559
I'm allergic to it.

00:09:23.759 --> 00:09:24.639
Same with coffee.

00:09:24.639 --> 00:09:25.960
So you don't have to prepare any for me.

00:09:27.919 --> 00:09:29.799
You could try mixing milk and coffee.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:30.960
Fight poison with poison.

00:09:37.679 --> 00:09:39.399
Has anyone ever told you that you're too serious?

00:09:39.399 --> 00:09:40.879
You didn't even laugh at my joke.

00:09:41.080 --> 00:09:42.639
I'm afraid if I make a joke,

00:09:43.320 --> 00:09:44.000
you won't be able to handle it.

00:09:45.840 --> 00:09:46.960
I didn't expect that.

00:09:47.559 --> 00:09:48.799
Do you like novels?

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:51.080
Jin Yong?

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:52.200
Qiong Yao?

00:09:52.519 --> 00:09:54.279
I just read whatever everyone else reads.

00:09:54.960 --> 00:09:55.799
What about poetry?

00:09:58.159 --> 00:09:59.480
That means no.

00:10:00.519 --> 00:10:01.480
I love it.

00:10:01.759 --> 00:10:03.759
In Shanghai's *Juvenile Literature*,

00:10:03.759 --> 00:10:05.000
I even published a short poem before.

00:10:05.399 --> 00:10:06.639
Do you know Shu Ting?

00:10:07.799 --> 00:10:08.679
Misty Poetry?

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:09.960
*Goddess Peak*?

00:10:14.639 --> 00:10:15.320
You really don't know?

00:10:18.919 --> 00:10:19.440
Alright, then.

00:10:20.360 --> 00:10:21.320
It's your turn on shift.

00:10:24.879 --> 00:10:25.879
Hand that over to me.

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:48.759
Take out the trash after your morning shower.

00:10:49.240 --> 00:10:50.000
Also,

00:10:50.399 --> 00:10:51.759
I shouldn't be the one preparing milk for breakfast.

00:10:52.720 --> 00:10:54.039
You stole me away from

00:10:54.039 --> 00:10:56.000
a brilliant applied chemist.

00:10:56.240 --> 00:10:57.000
How did you pull that off?

00:10:57.759 --> 00:10:58.960
It could only be eight words:

00:10:59.480 --> 00:11:00.840
Constant care and concern,

00:11:01.440 --> 00:11:02.879
and thoughtful attentiveness.

00:11:03.159 --> 00:11:04.399
So tomorrow morning, please prepare

00:11:04.399 --> 00:11:05.440
my favorite milk,

00:11:05.440 --> 00:11:06.440
and remember to warm it up.

00:11:06.799 --> 00:11:07.519
Thank you.

00:12:42.039 --> 00:12:43.919
I notice you always eat faster than others,

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:45.159
a lot faster, too.

00:12:45.159 --> 00:12:45.919
Why is that?

00:12:46.559 --> 00:12:47.600
The guy next door is the same.

00:12:47.600 --> 00:12:48.480
Have you noticed?

00:12:49.759 --> 00:12:51.399
Maybe that's true for anyone who served in the army.

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:53.679
In those three months of boot camp,

00:12:54.039 --> 00:12:55.679
if you ate too slowly, there'd be nothing left.

00:12:56.120 --> 00:12:57.759
Wonder if it's the same in Taiwan, China.

00:12:58.320 --> 00:12:58.759
By the way,

00:13:00.480 --> 00:13:01.519
what does this mean?

00:13:03.799 --> 00:13:04.840
Whenever he's home,

00:13:05.080 --> 00:13:05.919
at this exact time every day,

00:13:06.039 --> 00:13:07.159
his alarm goes off.

00:13:08.200 --> 00:13:09.600
I suspect it's a radio.

00:13:10.120 --> 00:13:11.679
If his identity is confirmed,

00:13:12.200 --> 00:13:13.600
what comes through that antenna

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:14.960
are orders from across the strait.

00:13:15.320 --> 00:13:16.519
But ever since I moved in,

00:13:16.519 --> 00:13:18.320
I haven't heard a peep from any radio.

00:13:18.759 --> 00:13:20.440
He's most likely wearing headphones.

00:13:21.799 --> 00:13:23.039
We could be guessing wrong, though.

00:13:23.799 --> 00:13:25.039
That's why we need to listen in day and night.

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:27.440
Log every tiny detail,

00:13:27.639 --> 00:13:28.919
then filter out the patterns.

00:13:29.759 --> 00:13:31.159
His daily routine,

00:13:31.600 --> 00:13:32.519
his personal habits,

00:13:32.879 --> 00:13:33.679
when he leaves,

00:13:33.679 --> 00:13:34.399
when he comes back,

00:13:34.399 --> 00:13:35.519
and who comes and goes.

00:13:35.879 --> 00:13:36.600
It could take a few months,

00:13:36.600 --> 00:13:37.840
or as long as four or five years.

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:40.120
No one knows when he'll slip up.

00:13:40.399 --> 00:13:41.200
All we can do is wait.

00:13:43.919 --> 00:13:45.639
Wait day in and day out,

00:13:47.039 --> 00:13:47.879
and stick it out.

00:13:48.600 --> 00:13:49.519
Starting today,

00:13:49.759 --> 00:13:50.600
we're doing three shifts.

00:13:50.879 --> 00:13:51.919
We'll take turns resting.

00:13:52.039 --> 00:13:53.279
Old Wei warned me before we came:

00:13:54.039 --> 00:13:55.519
this might end quickly,

00:13:56.759 --> 00:13:58.240
or we could be tracking him for over ten years.

00:13:58.240 --> 00:13:59.559
Can you hold out?

00:14:00.600 --> 00:14:01.720
What I'm saying is,

00:14:01.720 --> 00:14:03.759
let me know early if you can't handle it.

00:14:03.919 --> 00:14:05.919
We can't swap partners too often.

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:07.480
What kind of person would that make me look like?

00:14:07.679 --> 00:14:09.759
Well, maybe you'll break first.

00:14:10.440 --> 00:14:12.080
If I bring in another girlfriend,

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:13.879
people will say I'm fickle,

00:14:13.879 --> 00:14:15.080
and I'll end up looking like

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:16.320
a despised cheat.

00:14:17.039 --> 00:14:18.320
I've never even dated anyone!

00:14:23.679 --> 00:14:24.840
Wu Jiali taught me this:

00:14:25.320 --> 00:14:26.480
anyone in surveillance

00:14:26.960 --> 00:14:29.120
must separate their personal life from work.

00:14:29.519 --> 00:14:31.120
The cleaner the split, the longer you last.

00:14:31.399 --> 00:14:32.679
If you can't, you're in trouble.

00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:43.960
I'll just sleep on the couch.

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:46.080
The couch is only for

00:14:46.080 --> 00:14:47.840
when we fight or give each other the silent treatment.

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:49.639
I just dumped my boyfriend for you,

00:14:49.879 --> 00:14:51.399
and the swelling on your face hasn't gone down yet.

00:14:51.519 --> 00:14:52.720
We have to sleep in the same bed.

00:14:53.000 --> 00:14:55.279
We must get used to the bed so there are no slip-ups.

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:57.120
I'm going to sleep first.

00:14:57.120 --> 00:14:57.960
I'll relieve you in the middle of the night.

00:15:00.200 --> 00:15:02.080
If the guy next door goes to sleep,

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:03.519
do I still have to monitor him all night?

00:15:04.600 --> 00:15:06.200
What if he gets up in the middle of the night?

00:15:07.399 --> 00:15:09.080
We're waiting for that one-in-a-million chance.

00:15:15.120 --> 00:15:16.679
Have you never dated anyone either?

00:15:16.799 --> 00:15:18.480
Why are you so shy around girls?

00:15:20.720 --> 00:15:21.720
Have you ever kissed anyone?

00:15:23.200 --> 00:15:24.639
I know you kissed Huadong.

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:28.240
Huadong told me.

00:17:01.320 --> 00:17:02.679
Haven't seen you around before.

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:03.840
New faces?

00:17:04.039 --> 00:17:04.720
Yes.

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:06.079
What about the soldier who used to be here?

00:17:07.200 --> 00:17:08.079
Discharged.

00:18:28.200 --> 00:18:28.960
What's wrong?

00:18:30.039 --> 00:18:30.640
Sorry about that.

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:32.400
I didn't know you slept in like this.

00:18:32.559 --> 00:18:33.880
What's the rush on the weekend?

00:18:34.119 --> 00:18:35.160
One is a businessman,

00:18:35.160 --> 00:18:35.960
the other a tour guide.

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:37.160
Why would they be up so early?

00:18:37.400 --> 00:18:39.279
You think you're still doing military morning drills?

00:18:40.319 --> 00:18:42.440
Anyway, it's your listening shift now.

00:18:43.160 --> 00:18:45.039
Hold the washbasin steady next time.

00:18:45.240 --> 00:18:46.200
I was just dreaming about a raise,

00:18:46.200 --> 00:18:47.319
and you startled me awake.

00:18:49.680 --> 00:18:50.160
Wait, something's off.

00:18:52.000 --> 00:18:52.599
What is it?

00:18:53.440 --> 00:18:54.200
The day before yesterday,

00:18:54.480 --> 00:18:55.400
and last week too...

00:18:55.759 --> 00:18:57.240
When I came back alongside the neighbor,

00:18:57.240 --> 00:18:58.160
you opened the door for me.

00:18:58.319 --> 00:18:59.119
What did you say?

00:18:59.720 --> 00:19:00.640
Nothing at all.

00:19:01.160 --> 00:19:03.680
If we were passionately in love and just moved in,

00:19:03.920 --> 00:19:04.759
what would you do?

00:19:05.279 --> 00:19:06.279
You'd call me.

00:19:06.440 --> 00:19:07.480
Call non-stop.

00:19:07.599 --> 00:19:09.319
If I wasn't home by ten-thirty,

00:19:09.480 --> 00:19:10.759
you'd switch to calling every minute.

00:19:11.119 --> 00:19:12.559
You'd check if I had too much to drink,

00:19:12.759 --> 00:19:13.839
or if I was passed out on the sidewalk.

00:19:16.759 --> 00:19:18.799
People have different personalities.

00:19:19.359 --> 00:19:20.720
That's plausible enough.

00:19:23.880 --> 00:19:25.400
Is there any way to fix it?

00:19:28.599 --> 00:19:31.359
I don't think we act like a couple right now.

00:19:33.119 --> 00:19:34.799
Not like a couple where I took a beating for you.

00:19:40.160 --> 00:19:41.319
Do you know what people in love

00:19:41.319 --> 00:19:43.119
do first thing in the morning?

00:19:44.400 --> 00:19:45.039
Hug.

00:19:48.839 --> 00:19:49.480
Kiss.

00:19:51.400 --> 00:19:52.160
Brush their teeth.

00:19:52.519 --> 00:19:54.680
In the honeymoon phase, you'd care about their feelings.

00:19:56.599 --> 00:19:57.799
Have you really never kissed someone?

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:07.000
I've brushed my teeth.

00:20:14.200 --> 00:20:15.759
I haven't, so only on the cheek.

00:20:29.960 --> 00:20:30.640
How'd it go?

00:20:37.279 --> 00:20:38.279
You missed.

00:21:04.599 --> 00:21:05.400
What about this time?

00:21:13.960 --> 00:21:15.319
Like an eraser.

00:21:16.680 --> 00:21:18.279
Your mouth is like playdough.

00:21:42.359 --> 00:21:43.079
It is understood that,

00:21:43.440 --> 00:21:45.440
under the repatriation agreement reached

00:21:45.559 --> 00:21:48.200
in Kinmen by Red Cross organizations across the Strait,

00:21:48.759 --> 00:21:49.680
relevant mainland authorities

00:21:49.799 --> 00:21:52.359
have conducted repatriations on multiple occasions.

00:21:53.039 --> 00:21:54.200
Authorities stated that

00:21:54.279 --> 00:21:56.400
they firmly oppose any illegal activities that endanger

00:21:56.400 --> 00:21:58.400
the lives and property of people across the Strait,

00:21:58.519 --> 00:22:00.799
and will safeguard normal cross-strait exchanges.

00:22:01.400 --> 00:22:03.480
Both sides should act in the spirit of the agreement

00:22:03.759 --> 00:22:06.039
and properly handle repatriation matters.

00:22:06.359 --> 00:22:07.079
It was also made clear that

00:22:07.240 --> 00:22:09.519
espionage that endangers national security

00:22:09.559 --> 00:22:11.000
will always be met with zero tolerance.

00:22:11.519 --> 00:22:13.200
Once such acts are verified,

00:22:13.519 --> 00:22:15.559
state security organs and competent authorities

00:22:15.720 --> 00:22:17.640
will hold offenders legally accountable.

00:22:41.440 --> 00:22:42.400
Anything new?

00:22:43.799 --> 00:22:45.079
Pretty much the same as usual.

00:22:45.079 --> 00:22:46.400
They didn't discuss anything special.

00:22:46.720 --> 00:22:47.400
Sir.

00:22:48.319 --> 00:22:50.279
Should we go search next door?

00:22:50.599 --> 00:22:51.880
See if there's any evidence?

00:22:56.000 --> 00:22:58.000
That's exactly what they're waiting to see.

00:22:58.799 --> 00:22:59.559
If you go in,

00:22:59.759 --> 00:23:00.519
search around,

00:23:01.119 --> 00:23:02.079
and check everywhere,

00:23:02.400 --> 00:23:03.799
you'll leave footprints behind,

00:23:04.079 --> 00:23:05.400
and that'll cause problems.

00:23:06.039 --> 00:23:07.559
Keep drilling this into your heads:

00:23:08.440 --> 00:23:10.880
You're just students renting a place here.

00:23:11.640 --> 00:23:12.880
Unless there's danger,

00:23:13.119 --> 00:23:14.480
the more suspicious you are,

00:23:15.359 --> 00:23:16.880
the more you must stay away from next door.

00:23:17.720 --> 00:23:18.519
If we don't go in,

00:23:18.799 --> 00:23:20.440
how do we know if something's off with him?

00:23:20.960 --> 00:23:22.559
Use your head!

00:23:22.799 --> 00:23:24.480
Situations can change in countless ways.

00:23:24.480 --> 00:23:25.519
How do you think we find out?

00:23:26.799 --> 00:23:27.599
Sir,

00:23:28.519 --> 00:23:29.799
if we can't sneak in,

00:23:30.839 --> 00:23:32.200
then let's just go in openly.

00:23:58.960 --> 00:23:59.599
Come in.

00:24:01.359 --> 00:24:01.920
Director Jiao.

00:24:02.160 --> 00:24:03.480
I want to report Cao Liaoping.

00:24:04.519 --> 00:24:05.359
I have evidence.

00:24:19.160 --> 00:24:20.680
Lao Jia, come in, come in.

00:24:21.359 --> 00:24:22.359
What is it?

00:24:22.759 --> 00:24:24.039
Have a seat and take your time. Come.

00:24:24.359 --> 00:24:26.039
I just wanted to ask you...

00:24:26.319 --> 00:24:27.960
A notice came down recently, right?

00:24:28.200 --> 00:24:30.279
About attending an academic conference in Hong Kong, China.

00:24:30.480 --> 00:24:31.559
I figured that each office

00:24:31.559 --> 00:24:32.960
only gets one spot to go.

00:24:33.200 --> 00:24:34.400
I wonder, between Cao Liaoping and me,

00:24:34.400 --> 00:24:35.720
who are you planning to send?

00:24:39.480 --> 00:24:40.279
Look, how about this:

00:24:40.640 --> 00:24:41.559
In ten minutes...

00:24:42.039 --> 00:24:42.480
All right.

00:24:46.680 --> 00:24:47.440
Lao Cao.

00:24:47.680 --> 00:24:48.440
Jia Chunlin.

00:24:48.440 --> 00:24:49.000
Lao Cao.

00:25:19.759 --> 00:25:20.559
He Chunxiao!

00:25:21.039 --> 00:25:22.279
Come see who's here!

00:25:25.519 --> 00:25:26.359
Boss Lin!

00:25:26.559 --> 00:25:28.079
It takes a hundred years of destiny to cross paths.

00:25:28.920 --> 00:25:30.880
I moved all the way from Taiwan, China to next door,

00:25:30.880 --> 00:25:32.559
so I should have come to visit earlier.

00:25:33.079 --> 00:25:34.000
Come on in, come on in.

00:25:34.000 --> 00:25:34.359
Come on in.

00:25:34.359 --> 00:25:34.839
Come in and take a seat.

00:25:35.000 --> 00:25:35.559
Please come in.

00:25:35.559 --> 00:25:37.079
Who're you aiming that knife at?

00:25:37.160 --> 00:25:38.160
I was just chopping vegetables.

00:25:39.079 --> 00:25:39.720
Take a seat inside.

00:25:39.839 --> 00:25:41.200
Can't break Taipei customs.

00:25:42.839 --> 00:25:44.160
Am I interrupting your meal?

00:25:44.200 --> 00:25:44.759
Not at all, not at all.

00:25:44.759 --> 00:25:46.119
We got up late today

00:25:46.119 --> 00:25:47.079
and haven't eaten yet.

00:25:47.279 --> 00:25:48.319
I just happened to make shrimp congee.

00:25:48.519 --> 00:25:49.079
Let me check the stove.

00:25:49.079 --> 00:25:49.799
Stay and eat with us.

00:25:49.799 --> 00:25:50.720
No rush.

00:25:51.000 --> 00:25:51.680
Please, have a seat.

00:25:51.680 --> 00:25:52.839
I'll pour you a cup of tea.

00:26:01.759 --> 00:26:03.920
Chunxiao and I don't usually drink tea,

00:26:03.920 --> 00:26:05.480
so I don't know if this flavor

00:26:05.480 --> 00:26:06.519
will suit your taste.

00:26:06.920 --> 00:26:08.119
Any tea is fine.

00:26:29.160 --> 00:26:29.559
It's a bit messy here.

00:26:29.559 --> 00:26:30.920
Let me help tidy up.

00:26:31.119 --> 00:26:31.880
I've got it. I'll do it.

00:26:32.119 --> 00:26:34.359
Just sit. Guests shouldn't lift a finger.

00:26:34.559 --> 00:26:35.920
Even in Taiwan, China, there's no such rule.

00:26:42.039 --> 00:26:43.039
Don't fuss so much.

00:26:43.039 --> 00:26:43.599
Let me help.

00:26:43.799 --> 00:26:44.160
No need.

00:26:44.160 --> 00:26:44.759
Boss Lin.

00:26:44.960 --> 00:26:46.599
I was actually going to talk to you today.

00:26:46.599 --> 00:26:47.480
Didn't expect you'd come over.

00:26:47.720 --> 00:26:48.400
Have a seat, please.

00:26:48.720 --> 00:26:49.319
Here's the thing.

00:26:49.519 --> 00:26:51.799
There's an issue at Overseas Chinese Hospital.

00:26:52.039 --> 00:26:54.440
We might need to replace more lead glass panels.

00:26:54.440 --> 00:26:55.519
The previous one won't do.

00:26:55.720 --> 00:26:56.400
It can't block radiation.

00:26:56.400 --> 00:26:56.920
As you know,

00:26:56.920 --> 00:26:58.480
radiation leaks cause major problems.

00:26:58.599 --> 00:27:00.000
So as for our budget,

00:27:00.000 --> 00:27:01.720
we might have to raise it a bit.

00:27:01.720 --> 00:27:03.160
You can decide that on your own.

00:27:03.160 --> 00:27:04.240
No need to run it by me.

00:27:04.680 --> 00:27:05.920
Without this little bit of trust,

00:27:05.920 --> 00:27:08.319
how can we do business and make money together?

00:27:09.319 --> 00:27:09.880
Jinlan.

00:27:10.799 --> 00:27:11.920
A small gift from Taiwan, China.

00:27:12.079 --> 00:27:12.960
Hope you like it.

00:27:14.720 --> 00:27:15.480
Thank you.

00:27:17.279 --> 00:27:18.160
It's reversible.

00:27:18.160 --> 00:27:19.200
Sun Moon Lake on one side,

00:27:19.400 --> 00:27:20.480
and Alishan on the other.

00:27:20.480 --> 00:27:21.519
Two different styles, see?

00:27:21.519 --> 00:27:22.559
It's really pretty.

00:27:22.559 --> 00:27:23.759
Fits your line of work.

00:27:23.759 --> 00:27:25.240
No worries about wind and sun.

00:27:25.319 --> 00:27:27.319
Thanks, we didn't know you were coming,

00:27:27.319 --> 00:27:28.200
let alone bringing a gift.

00:27:28.440 --> 00:27:29.920
Look, we didn't prepare anything.

00:27:29.920 --> 00:27:30.920
Why be so polite?

00:27:30.920 --> 00:27:32.039
Just owe me for now.

00:27:32.039 --> 00:27:32.960
We're neighbors.

00:27:32.960 --> 00:27:33.720
You're not going anywhere.

00:27:33.720 --> 00:27:34.559
You can pay me back later.

00:27:37.079 --> 00:27:38.359
The blue of the Taiwan Strait.

00:27:38.559 --> 00:27:39.920
It's on the news every day.

00:27:40.240 --> 00:27:41.799
One sea, one family.

00:27:43.039 --> 00:27:44.240
It's for you. Try it on.

00:27:46.160 --> 00:27:47.119
Jinlan, give me a hand.

00:27:48.799 --> 00:27:49.599
Let me see.

00:27:51.119 --> 00:27:52.440
My dad only had one tie at home,

00:27:52.440 --> 00:27:53.960
and it was a zipper tie.

00:27:54.160 --> 00:27:55.279
I'll learn from someone later.

00:27:55.279 --> 00:27:56.160
Neither of you knows how?

00:27:57.720 --> 00:27:58.480
Let me do it.

00:27:59.359 --> 00:28:00.839
A man needs to know how to tie a tie.

00:28:00.839 --> 00:28:02.400
A woman needs to know how to tie one too.

00:28:02.400 --> 00:28:03.279
Otherwise,

00:28:04.039 --> 00:28:05.240
how can you make a life together?

00:28:09.000 --> 00:28:09.839
There, good to go.

00:28:10.079 --> 00:28:10.759
That was quick.

00:28:11.359 --> 00:28:12.359
Adjust the tightness yourself.

00:28:12.880 --> 00:28:13.440
Try it out.

00:28:13.440 --> 00:28:14.240
Give it a try.

00:28:16.240 --> 00:28:16.720
Jinlan.

00:28:16.720 --> 00:28:17.519
Take a look. How is it?

00:28:20.000 --> 00:28:20.799
Looks good.

00:28:21.240 --> 00:28:23.200
Right? I just love this blue.

00:28:24.799 --> 00:28:26.440
Is your porridge burning?

00:28:26.759 --> 00:28:27.519
I forgot about it!

00:28:32.440 --> 00:28:34.599
Usually, when He Chunxiao is with us,

00:28:34.599 --> 00:28:36.200
he always dodges his drinks.

00:28:36.480 --> 00:28:37.680
But at home, he's not afraid to get drunk.

00:28:38.240 --> 00:28:39.920
Even if you paid him, he wouldn't drink.

00:28:40.160 --> 00:28:41.039
Those are all mine.

00:28:43.039 --> 00:28:44.079
Well, you're pretty tough then.

00:28:44.240 --> 00:28:45.799
Do you guys drink morning liquor here?

00:28:45.799 --> 00:28:47.039
With porridge and crispy rice?

00:28:47.039 --> 00:28:48.039
Want to have a little?

00:28:48.880 --> 00:28:49.759
Let's have some.

00:28:50.759 --> 00:28:52.160
Where's the restroom? Let me wash my hands.

00:28:52.519 --> 00:28:53.880
Right over here, follow me.

00:29:02.720 --> 00:29:04.079
You can't make porridge on high heat.

00:29:04.079 --> 00:29:05.279
Simmer it on low heat.

00:29:05.519 --> 00:29:06.319
Got it.

00:29:42.480 --> 00:29:45.160
The torrent of coneflowers and privets

00:29:45.680 --> 00:29:47.319
Is inciting a new betrayal.

00:29:48.240 --> 00:29:50.880
Rather than being displayed on a cliff for a thousand years,

00:29:51.359 --> 00:29:54.799
Better to weep on a lover's shoulder for a night.

00:29:55.279 --> 00:29:57.359
Whose hand was suddenly pulled back,

00:29:58.000 --> 00:30:00.200
Tightly covering their own eyes?

00:30:01.200 --> 00:30:03.000
When the crowd disperses in all directions,

00:30:03.519 --> 00:30:05.200
Who is still standing at the stern?

00:30:07.359 --> 00:30:08.400
Tell me,

00:30:08.400 --> 00:30:10.519
does writing poetry always require talent?

00:30:10.839 --> 00:30:12.240
How could she write so well?

00:30:12.480 --> 00:30:13.759
Everything takes talent.

00:30:14.440 --> 00:30:15.519
Don't you think so?

00:30:15.799 --> 00:30:17.480
Even driving, repairing shoes,

00:30:17.480 --> 00:30:18.599
cooking meals,

00:30:18.920 --> 00:30:20.319
building houses, performing surgery...

00:30:20.319 --> 00:30:21.640
It's the same for us tour guides.

00:30:21.640 --> 00:30:23.200
Some people are natural-born talents,

00:30:23.200 --> 00:30:25.200
while others couldn't learn it to save their lives.

00:30:25.200 --> 00:30:26.440
A lot of things just can't be taught.

00:30:26.440 --> 00:30:27.200
Right?

00:30:28.400 --> 00:30:31.319
Then what do you think I'm best suited for?

00:30:32.039 --> 00:30:33.640
Poetry is definitely out of the question.

00:30:33.960 --> 00:30:35.759
Isn't doing business enough for you, Boss Lin?

00:30:35.759 --> 00:30:36.640
What else do you want to do?

00:30:37.759 --> 00:30:38.319
What about you?

00:30:38.799 --> 00:30:40.200
If you weren't a tour guide,

00:30:41.000 --> 00:30:42.160
what would you want to do most?

00:30:43.440 --> 00:30:45.160
I want to try everything I haven't done.

00:30:45.680 --> 00:30:47.640
I wanted to join the army—an arts troupe.

00:30:48.000 --> 00:30:49.759
I wanted to drive—drive a train.

00:30:49.759 --> 00:30:50.680
I wanted to be a translator.

00:30:50.680 --> 00:30:51.519
A ship captain.

00:30:51.519 --> 00:30:53.559
Steering an enormous ship out to sea.

00:30:53.839 --> 00:30:54.920
When I was little, I also envied

00:30:54.920 --> 00:30:56.400
classmates who wrote great essays.

00:30:56.400 --> 00:30:57.759
I thought I could write, too,

00:30:57.759 --> 00:30:58.920
but I always did poorly on exams.

00:30:58.920 --> 00:31:01.440
My mom told me grades didn't matter.

00:31:01.440 --> 00:31:02.880
Being a poet doesn't require grades.

00:31:03.200 --> 00:31:04.759
You write whatever you want to write.

00:31:04.759 --> 00:31:06.200
He always thinks my head is in the clouds,

00:31:06.200 --> 00:31:07.039
that I'm unrealistic.

00:31:07.119 --> 00:31:09.240
Life is just too dull and boring.

00:31:09.240 --> 00:31:10.799
If I didn't let my imagination run wild,

00:31:10.799 --> 00:31:12.079
how could I even get by?

00:31:12.079 --> 00:31:13.960
Bosses from Taiwan, China never lack romance.

00:31:14.240 --> 00:31:15.359
It won't be dull.

00:31:15.920 --> 00:31:18.799
Roots, clutched tight beneath the ground;

00:31:19.279 --> 00:31:21.359
Leaves, touching amid the clouds.

00:31:21.799 --> 00:31:23.200
With every gust of wind,

00:31:23.519 --> 00:31:24.960
we greet each other,

00:31:25.559 --> 00:31:27.599
but no one can understand our words.

00:31:28.240 --> 00:31:30.000
You have your copper boughs and iron trunk,

00:31:30.200 --> 00:31:32.799
like knives, like swords, and like halberds;

00:31:33.160 --> 00:31:34.839
I have my crimson, massive blossoms,

00:31:34.920 --> 00:31:36.359
like heavy sighs,

00:31:36.960 --> 00:31:38.279
and like valiant torches.

00:31:38.640 --> 00:31:41.960
We share the cold waves, storms, and lightning;

00:31:42.599 --> 00:31:46.000
We share the mist, lingering vapors, and rainbows,

00:31:46.799 --> 00:31:50.000
seemingly parted forever, yet bound for life.

00:31:50.440 --> 00:31:52.720
*To the Oak* is also a poem by Shu Ting.

00:31:53.200 --> 00:31:55.079
Boss Lin probably hasn't had love like that,

00:31:55.240 --> 00:31:56.880
which is why he finds life so dull.

00:31:58.160 --> 00:31:59.160
In my lifetime,

00:31:59.160 --> 00:32:01.119
I'll never have anything like that.

00:32:01.119 --> 00:32:02.400
Not like the two of you.

00:32:03.319 --> 00:32:04.759
Never mind toasting the two of you.

00:32:04.759 --> 00:32:05.640
A toast to this poem.

00:32:05.880 --> 00:32:07.000
All right, cheers.

00:32:07.480 --> 00:32:07.880
Cheers.

00:32:17.440 --> 00:32:18.039
Careful, careful.

00:32:18.039 --> 00:32:18.720
Are you okay?

00:32:19.000 --> 00:32:19.640
Are you all right?

00:32:19.640 --> 00:32:20.359
Careful, watch out for the glass.

00:32:20.359 --> 00:32:21.039
I'm sorry, my apologies.

00:32:21.039 --> 00:32:21.839
The bathroom, the bathroom...

00:32:21.839 --> 00:32:22.319
There's a rag.

00:32:23.640 --> 00:32:25.839
My hands shook from drinking. I'm sorry.

00:32:33.440 --> 00:32:35.160
First time I've seen such a huge radio.

00:32:35.640 --> 00:32:36.519
It can't play cassettes?

00:32:36.519 --> 00:32:37.799
Can it only tune into broadcasts?

00:32:38.400 --> 00:32:39.400
The landlord left it behind.

00:32:39.400 --> 00:32:40.640
He refused to take it with him.

00:32:40.839 --> 00:32:42.279
If you like it, take it.

00:32:42.279 --> 00:32:43.279
Really?

00:32:44.359 --> 00:32:45.480
Then don't mind if I do.

00:32:46.119 --> 00:32:48.039
An imported one. First time seeing it.

00:32:49.200 --> 00:32:50.799
Carrying my father's ashes,

00:32:51.079 --> 00:32:52.519
returning from Taipei.

00:32:53.319 --> 00:32:54.880
He said it's been nearly 40 years.

00:33:01.160 --> 00:33:01.880
Director Jiao,

00:33:01.960 --> 00:33:03.240
I want to report Cao Liaoping.

00:33:03.480 --> 00:33:04.319
I have evidence.

00:33:28.079 --> 00:33:28.759
Come in.

00:33:33.000 --> 00:33:34.920
Engineer Cao, here's your medical checkup report.

00:33:35.240 --> 00:33:37.119
Please sign right here.

00:33:37.240 --> 00:33:37.839
All right.

00:33:43.400 --> 00:33:43.880
There you go.

00:33:43.880 --> 00:33:44.599
Thank you.

00:35:17.960 --> 00:35:19.400
Page the owner of this pager.

00:35:19.679 --> 00:35:22.239
My name is Zhu. Say medicine is urgently needed.

00:35:22.639 --> 00:35:24.079
Please page three times in a row.

00:35:29.920 --> 00:35:30.960
Boss Lin, please make do with this.

00:35:31.079 --> 00:35:31.920
These are the only cups we have.

00:35:31.920 --> 00:35:32.960
We don't have any other cups.

00:35:32.960 --> 00:35:34.119
Sorry about that, my apologies.

00:35:34.119 --> 00:35:35.800
I'll buy some new ones another day.

00:35:37.079 --> 00:35:37.599
Sorry.

00:35:37.960 --> 00:35:39.039
This is my cup.

00:35:39.960 --> 00:35:40.599
This one's mine.

00:35:40.719 --> 00:35:41.800
No worries, it works all the same.

00:35:41.800 --> 00:35:42.840
All the same, all the same.

00:35:55.719 --> 00:35:57.400
Boss Lin, so busy even on a weekend?

00:35:57.400 --> 00:35:59.039
Which girlfriend is looking for you this time?

00:36:00.239 --> 00:36:01.280
It's the factory.

00:36:01.440 --> 00:36:02.800
Can't even make a pair of jeans properly.

00:36:03.000 --> 00:36:04.000
The seams come apart every day.

00:36:05.039 --> 00:36:05.599
I'm heading out.

00:36:05.599 --> 00:36:06.119
Here.

00:36:06.840 --> 00:36:07.719
A toast to you both.

00:36:07.719 --> 00:36:09.079
I'll visit again next time.

00:36:13.960 --> 00:36:15.280
I'll drop by another day.

00:36:16.079 --> 00:36:16.920
You're so busy, Boss Lin.

00:36:16.920 --> 00:36:17.719
Take good care of yourself.

00:36:18.880 --> 00:36:20.400
They come to me for every little thing.

00:36:20.400 --> 00:36:21.400
Just born to toil.

00:36:21.400 --> 00:36:22.079
I'm off.

00:36:22.239 --> 00:36:23.079
Safe travels.

00:36:28.000 --> 00:36:29.519
I thought you didn't know Shu Ting.

00:36:30.599 --> 00:36:32.039
After you fell asleep last night,

00:36:32.039 --> 00:36:33.800
I wanted to see what poems she wrote.

00:36:33.800 --> 00:36:35.159
Why do you like her so much?

00:36:36.400 --> 00:36:38.159
I don't have many strong points,

00:36:38.159 --> 00:36:39.119
but I have a great memory.

00:36:39.119 --> 00:36:40.159
Some things,

00:36:40.159 --> 00:36:41.559
once I see them, I never forget.

00:36:41.559 --> 00:36:43.440
It's "flowing mist," not "lingering."

00:36:44.440 --> 00:36:45.159
Really?

00:36:45.159 --> 00:36:46.119
See for yourself.

00:36:52.880 --> 00:36:53.480
Trash.

00:38:03.199 --> 00:38:03.920
Off work.

00:38:33.960 --> 00:38:35.000
In our three years of high school,

00:38:36.679 --> 00:38:39.079
our homeroom teacher must've hit menopause.

00:38:39.079 --> 00:38:41.639
Nagging on and on every single day.

00:38:42.360 --> 00:38:43.599
With all that rambling,

00:38:43.880 --> 00:38:45.199
who could possibly remember it?

00:38:45.960 --> 00:38:46.639
But Chunlin,

00:38:47.440 --> 00:38:48.760
there's one thing she said

00:38:50.000 --> 00:38:51.320
that I remember vividly.

00:38:52.559 --> 00:38:54.079
What "fate" really means.

00:38:54.760 --> 00:38:55.960
Just like the two of us,

00:38:56.800 --> 00:38:58.039
inseparable no matter what.

00:38:59.320 --> 00:39:00.559
That's fate.

00:39:02.039 --> 00:39:02.880
Think about it.

00:39:03.199 --> 00:39:03.840
In high school,

00:39:04.239 --> 00:39:05.599
we went to the same school,

00:39:06.119 --> 00:39:07.400
and both boarded there.

00:39:07.400 --> 00:39:08.639
Dorms right next to each other.

00:39:09.119 --> 00:39:10.519
Then for college,

00:39:11.400 --> 00:39:12.920
we both went off to Beijing.

00:39:13.280 --> 00:39:14.679
We climbed the wild Great Wall together.

00:39:14.960 --> 00:39:16.599
When the student union president bullied us,

00:39:16.800 --> 00:39:18.360
the two of us rebelled against him.

00:39:18.480 --> 00:39:19.800
I started a guitar club,

00:39:19.800 --> 00:39:21.079
and you started a literature club.

00:39:21.360 --> 00:39:22.159
Looking back now,

00:39:22.159 --> 00:39:24.519
we were so full of youthful vigor.

00:39:26.639 --> 00:39:27.599
At hometown gatherings,

00:39:28.360 --> 00:39:29.480
we drank this very same liquor.

00:39:29.880 --> 00:39:30.760
The taste hasn't changed.

00:39:32.159 --> 00:39:34.679
You said you couldn't get used to Beijing hot pot,

00:39:34.679 --> 00:39:35.760
so today,

00:39:35.760 --> 00:39:37.519
let's eat food from back home.

00:39:43.199 --> 00:39:45.559
I remember that day we both drank too much.

00:39:45.920 --> 00:39:47.159
I crashed in your dorm,

00:39:47.920 --> 00:39:49.360
and you stayed up in the middle of the night,

00:39:50.000 --> 00:39:52.159
doing nothing but venting about your breakup.

00:39:53.559 --> 00:39:55.119
You cried, and then I cried.

00:39:59.920 --> 00:40:01.119
Later, I set you up with a girlfriend.

00:40:01.119 --> 00:40:02.360
Talk about being timid—

00:40:02.519 --> 00:40:03.920
going to meet a girl,

00:40:04.039 --> 00:40:05.360
you didn't even dare go alone.

00:40:05.360 --> 00:40:07.400
You had to drag me along with you.

00:40:07.400 --> 00:40:09.559
I introduced the girl to you,

00:40:09.880 --> 00:40:11.079
and yet I went along.

00:40:11.079 --> 00:40:12.159
How ridiculous was that?

00:40:30.920 --> 00:40:32.079
Where was I?

00:40:35.519 --> 00:40:36.400
Then we graduated,

00:40:37.159 --> 00:40:38.079
and got assigned jobs.

00:40:39.000 --> 00:40:40.719
Normally, you should've stayed in Beijing.

00:40:41.039 --> 00:40:42.719
Then your mother fell ill,

00:40:43.079 --> 00:40:44.239
so you returned to Minzhong.

00:40:44.880 --> 00:40:46.599
I never imagined

00:40:47.519 --> 00:40:49.280
you'd be assigned to Institute 761, too.

00:40:50.119 --> 00:40:51.239
We ended up at the same place,

00:40:51.440 --> 00:40:52.880
even sharing an office.

00:40:52.880 --> 00:40:54.280
If this isn't fate,

00:40:54.280 --> 00:40:55.239
then what is?

00:40:55.239 --> 00:40:56.920
Did they coerce you,

00:40:58.239 --> 00:40:59.719
or win you over?

00:41:03.440 --> 00:41:05.159
How much did they pay you?

00:41:08.039 --> 00:41:09.159
RMB?

00:41:10.559 --> 00:41:11.639
US dollars?

00:41:14.519 --> 00:41:15.639
Liaoping,

00:41:16.360 --> 00:41:17.800
personal feelings are one thing,

00:41:18.519 --> 00:41:19.800
but the nation is another.

00:41:21.159 --> 00:41:23.599
When it comes to cardinal questions of right and wrong,

00:41:23.960 --> 00:41:26.960
if you expect me to turn a blind eye,

00:41:28.079 --> 00:41:28.760
I

00:41:30.559 --> 00:41:31.559
can't do it.

00:41:34.039 --> 00:41:36.239
I have never done anything to betray our country.

00:41:36.239 --> 00:41:37.360
I can swear to heaven.

00:41:37.360 --> 00:41:38.119
I'll take a solemn oath!

00:41:38.119 --> 00:41:40.400
Do you dare swear before Mazu?

00:41:43.519 --> 00:41:44.880
Do you?

00:41:54.039 --> 00:41:55.880
I bet you wouldn't dare.

00:42:27.239 --> 00:42:27.800
Jia Chunlin

00:43:08.280 --> 00:43:09.280
I'm Peng Yuchang,

00:43:09.280 --> 00:43:10.880
inviting you to watch the TV drama

00:43:10.880 --> 00:43:11.719
*Confrontation*.

00:43:12.320 --> 00:43:13.119
Let me.

00:43:14.039 --> 00:43:14.960
The surgery is finished.

00:43:14.960 --> 00:43:16.119
The patient is out of danger for now.

00:43:16.519 --> 00:43:17.280
It's all code.

00:43:17.440 --> 00:43:19.280
Check where the phone line runs.

00:43:19.280 --> 00:43:21.679
The top priority is to detain one of them.

00:43:21.679 --> 00:43:22.239
Whether to make an arrest,

00:43:22.239 --> 00:43:23.639
when, and where—

00:43:23.639 --> 00:43:24.880
must be decided today.

00:43:24.880 --> 00:43:25.840
Something is off at the Caos'.

00:43:26.119 --> 00:43:27.320
There's no wind, no rain...

00:43:27.320 --> 00:43:29.119
Why open an umbrella on the balcony?

00:43:29.239 --> 00:43:30.840
Most likely a signal. He's going to run.

00:43:31.159 --> 00:43:33.079
This Professor Cao left ahead of schedule.

00:43:33.079 --> 00:43:34.320
It's an urgent matter.

00:43:34.320 --> 00:43:35.559
We need you to head to Zhuhai.

00:43:36.039 --> 00:43:36.480
Immediately.